1
00:00:02,238 --> 00:00:04,208
Previously,
on The Big Bang Theory...

2
00:00:12,024 --> 00:00:13,644
(Howard's cousin(on skype):)Hello.

3
00:00:13,649 --> 00:00:16,279
I'm looking for Howard Wolowitz.

4
00:00:16,474 --> 00:00:18,504
May I ask what this is about?

5
00:00:18,509 --> 00:00:19,909
No, you may not.

6
00:00:19,911 --> 00:00:21,941
Very well.

7
00:00:24,082 --> 00:00:25,712
Hi... Colonel Williams.

8
00:00:25,717 --> 00:00:27,087
How can I help you?

9
00:00:27,085 --> 00:00:28,355
O-Okay.

10
00:00:28,353 --> 00:00:31,123
Sure, I can meet with you
on Thursday.

11
00:00:31,122 --> 00:00:32,522
Caltech is fine.

12
00:00:32,523 --> 00:00:34,993
Yeah, may I ask
what this is about?

13
00:00:36,361 --> 00:00:38,461
I may not?

14
00:00:38,463 --> 00:00:41,463
That's what he said to me.

15
00:00:42,633 --> 00:00:44,503
(Sheldon:)Look at this.

16
00:00:44,502 --> 00:00:47,602
(Sheldon:)Elon Musk has a theory
that we're all just characters

17
00:00:47,605 --> 00:00:50,745
(Sheldon:)in some advanced civilization's
video game.

18
00:00:50,742 --> 00:00:52,642
(Leonard:)So some alien kid spent
his money

19
00:00:52,643 --> 00:00:56,013
(Leonard:)on the asthma-and-glasses
upgrade for me?

20
00:00:57,248 --> 00:01:01,018
(Sheldon:)Well, he doesn't say
it's a good game.

